                    <p class="lead"> We deliver powerful SEO optimization strategies that improve search rankings, boost organic traffic, and strengthen your online presence. Our approach blends technical insights, keyword research, and result-driven execution to help your website achieve long-term visibility.</p>

                    <div class="service-image" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/seo.jpg")" alt="Digital Marketing" class="img-fluid rounded">
                    </div>

                    <p>Our SEO process focuses on optimizing every aspect of your website—from content to structure to performance. We use smart strategies, data-backed research, and continuous improvements to help your business rank higher and connect with the right audience.</p>

                    <!-- Service Features -->
                    <div class="service-features" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
