                                        Executing on-page and off-page optimizations that boost visibility and search performance.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">03</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Optimization</h5>
                                    <p>Analyzing results, adjusting strategies, and improving authority and relevance.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="step-item">
                                <div class="step-number">04</div>
                                <div class="step-content">
                                    <h5>Results Reporting</h5>
                                    <p>Delivering transparent performance reports showing growth, rankings, and future opportunities.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
